---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Apply to Zeta" description="Submit an initial recruitment application to explore a professional opportunity with Zeta.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-compact"><div class="shell narrow"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Recruitment Application</p><h1>Tell Us About Your Professional Direction</h1><p>This initial application helps Zeta understand your background, interests, readiness, and preferred pathway. Submission does not guarantee selection.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell form-layout"><aside class="form-aside"><h2>Before you begin</h2><ul class="check-list"><li>Answer accurately and in your own words.</li><li>Use an email address and mobile number you regularly check.</li><li>Do not submit confidential financial or identity documents at this stage.</li><li>Review the privacy and consent statement before submission.</li></ul><p class="verification-note">Final form fields, privacy language, licensing questions, and internal routing should receive legal, privacy, compliance, and recruitment review.</p></aside><form class="application-form" name="zeta-career-application" method="POST" action="/success" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field"><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="zeta-career-application" /><p class="visually-hidden"><label>Do not fill this out if you are human: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p><fieldset><legend>Basic information</legend><div class="form-grid"><label>Full name <input type="text" name="full-name" autocomplete="name" required /></label><label>Email address <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label><label>Mobile number <input type="tel" name="mobile" autocomplete="tel" required /></label><label>City or province <input type="text" name="location" autocomplete="address-level2" required /></label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Professional background</legend><div class="form-grid"><label>Current occupation or role <input type="text" name="current-role" required /></label><label>Years of professional experience <select name="experience-years" required><option value="">Select one</option><option>Less than 1 year</option><option>1–3 years</option><option>4–7 years</option><option>8 years or more</option></select></label></div><label>Relevant experience <span class="field-help">Select all that apply.</span><select name="relevant-experience" multiple size="7" required><option>Sales</option><option>Customer service</option><option>Banking, insurance, or financial services</option><option>Business development</option><option>Recruitment or people development</option><option>Leadership or management</option><option>Business ownership or entrepreneurship</option></select></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Career direction</legend><label>Which opportunity are you primarily exploring? <select name="pathway" required><option value="">Select one</option><option>Financial Advisor development</option><option>Experienced-professional opportunity</option><option>Leadership and organization building</option><option>I need more information before deciding</option></select></label><label>Why are you interested in Zeta and financial services? <textarea name="motivation" rows="5" required minlength="80"></textarea></label><label>What professional capability would you most like to develop in the next 12 months? <textarea name="development-goal" rows="4" required></textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Readiness and availability</legend><div class="form-grid"><label>Current licensing status <select name="licensing-status" required><option value="">Select one</option><option>Currently licensed</option><option>Previously licensed</option><option>Currently processing requirements</option><option>Not yet licensed</option><option>I need more information about licensing</option></select></label><label>Preferred level of participation <select name="participation" required><option value="">Select one</option><option>Full-time professional pathway</option><option>Part-time or alongside current work</option><option>Still exploring</option></select></label><label>Weekly availability for development activities <select name="weekly-availability" required><option value="">Select one</option><option>Less than 5 hours</option><option>5–10 hours</option><option>11–20 hours</option><option>More than 20 hours</option><option>Schedule varies and needs discussion</option></select></label><label>Earliest possible start date <input type="date" name="start-date" /></label></div><label>Describe a time you received difficult feedback and how you applied it. <textarea name="coachability-example" rows="5" required minlength="80"></textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Consent</legend><label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" name="accuracy-confirmed" required /> <span>I confirm that the information I provided is accurate to the best of my knowledge.</span></label><label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" name="contact-consent" required /> <span>I consent to being contacted by Zeta regarding this application and related recruitment steps.</span></label><label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" name="privacy-consent" required /> <span>I have read and agree to the <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>. I understand that submitting this form does not guarantee selection, employment, licensing, compensation, or advancement.</span></label></fieldset><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Submit Application</button></form></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
